## Getting started

Install [Task](https://taskfile.dev/#/installation) if you don't have it, then run:

```bash
task onboard
```

This installs `uv` and `task` (if missing), creates the virtual environment, and installs all dependencies.

If you already have `uv` and `task` installed:

```bash
task env      # create virtual environment
task install  # install dependencies
```

## Development

```bash
task lint      # run ruff linter
task format    # format code with ruff
task test      # run pytest
task check     # lint + test
```
